        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"8b082233-09cb-4180-81bd-7a3c5907ffcb\",\"review_text\":\"My best app🍃❤\"},{\"review_id\":\"f7bce636-26f5-4cfc-83df-d6f70ea92cf9\",\"review_text\":\"love love love spotify regardless of ads, but pls gimme back the option to play part of a song when i search it to add to a playlist i actually loved that feature sm :,)\"},{\"review_id\":\"bf470cbe-deea-459c-8430-9b710f15a9ea\",\"review_text\":\"Love your channel..\"},{\"review_id\":\"225fcf47-f4b7-4a4d-98b3-8cba875ae110\",\"review_text\":\"It's really useful and great because any song u search u get it and that lyrics❤️\"},{\"review_id\":\"ccd05e83-f88d-458b-90e3-19589ba2e8c0\",\"review_text\":\"Log in error\"},{\"review_id\":\"2cef0924-bf5f-4448-9479-98866f36baaf\",\"review_text\":\"I love Spotify so much and it is also my favourite app because music is what makes me happy and Spotify just gives me that you have so many songs too choose from and the playlists they make for you are amaizing thanks too this app I know my real taste in music. These 5 stars that I gave are well deserved 👏🏻\"},{\"review_id\":\"4ceaa4ff-d1c5-4f0d-984d-3e3224f4fa65\",\"review_text\":\"been a paying customer for years, absolutely disgusted with how biased they are towards certain artists.\"},{\"review_id\":\"967a57bf-6d87-41f5-ac9e-10840e45f340\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this app and swedan . I love Islam\"},{\"review_id\":\"515ee065-310d-4612-b3e5-39cf7ed13ac1\",\"review_text\":\":⁠-⁠|\"},{\"review_id\":\"4d313a9e-cfef-4236-b642-c9e9babdb633\",\"review_text\":\"Not searching proper songs\"}]}"
